{"unit_id":"MMMichelsa__dsh-plain-approvals#card-zh","repo":"MMMichelsa/dsh-plain-approvals","commit":"23dafcf12aaf06173a080aee42457604406ed170","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-plain-approvals 是一款面向 DSH 的审批与提问文案插件，会把操作审批说明改写成中文和英文的易读提示，并按读取、写入、删除或其他类别组织文案、展示可识别的文件路径。它在审批请求到达界面前处理展示文字，也会收集工具调用摘要以辅助说明操作类别；遇到非中文问题时，可调用当前模型改写问题、标题和选项描述，同时保留选项标签。适合希望更容易理解 DSH 审批卡片和模型问题的用户。问题改写使用当前 DSH 模型服务；插件不要求单独配置 API 密钥。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:1400-1466","lib/index.js:1019-1050","lib/index.js:1275-1392"]}
{"unit_id":"MMMichelsa__dsh-plain-approvals#card-en","repo":"MMMichelsa/dsh-plain-approvals","commit":"23dafcf12aaf06173a080aee42457604406ed170","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-plain-approvals makes DSH approval cards and model questions easier to understand. It formats approvals by operation type and shows detected paths. For non-Chinese questions, it uses the current model to rewrite text while preserving option labels. No separate API key is configured.","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:1400-1466","lib/index.js:1019-1050","lib/index.js:1275-1392"]}
