{"unit_id":"MMMichelsa__dsh-plain-approvals#feature-1","repo":"MMMichelsa/dsh-plain-approvals","commit":"23dafcf12aaf06173a080aee42457604406ed170","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-plain-approvals 的功能「审批说明改写」：把审批展示文字组织成中英文提示，并按读取、写入、删除或其他操作类别呈现。收到审批请求时自动处理；可用时会补充工具参数或命令中提取的文件路径。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:922-947","lib/index.js:1019-1050","lib/index.js:1428-1449"]}
